I found the preflight failure’s concrete cause: this sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` but hides `/proc/<numeric-pid>/exe`, while Lean 4.22’s runtime resolves its own executable through the numeric path. I’ll use a narrow audit-local preload shim that redirects only that executable lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter Lean, Lake, the project, or any audited input. The workaround and its diagnostic will be preserved as evidence.
